cktail Bars","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","review_id":"YtHaW0EOf7eV1h36Q4VWRg","date":"2018-11-19T20:09:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9390408992767334,"text_excerpt":"Auction House Market is such a cool and trendy place with some delicious food. Have been wanting to try for a while and finally made it. It would be the perfect place for a fun date or a girls night out or something like that. They also have a cool room off the side for private events that is furnished very nicely and looks super lush and fancy. The bar in the center is covered in plants which we just love. The food selection is varied which makes it good for anyone really. Food halls are really hard for me because I am extremely indecisive and coming here was no different. I ended up getting some food from Tava and some from sola deli. I love Indian food so I really enjoyed my food from ..."},{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","review_id":"m1XAaZJYx54zAf9Ts6RuXQ","date":"2019-01-14T20:36:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9380334615707397,"text_excerpt":"This place is amazing - the style is so fun and fresh and the stalls within the market are all worth a visit. My partner and I came here for a few drinks before dinner one night (after discovering it on a walk and grabbing coffee) and it was so reasonably priced and surprisingly empty. The bartender was a doll - the first drink on the specials menu was free and he gave us another drink on him after that as well! We ended up spending $12 on drinks and I just could not imagine spending that little on six drinks anywhere else (do not worry we tipped well). The decor has a very California feel - marble and bronze and tons of plants. Definitely check this place out for a drink/coffee if you ar..."},{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","review_id":"rLsI73BV2H4PrTD61OUl4Q","date":"2019-03-17T20:35:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9374507665634155,"text_excerpt":"I love Auction house market. It's a great spot for any meal, any time of day. It's always my go-to for days I'm undecided what to eat because I can get my Indian, poke, South American, and seafood fix all at the same time. The bar has really good cocktails, didn't get any this time (still recovering from Mardi Gras.) The space is conveniently located in the warehouse district, which is walkable from the lower garden district and CBD. I highly recommend this food hall."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","photo_id":"S_jQGins5vgjdGdDwvTL5g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/S_jQGins5vgjdGdDwvTL5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8927399516105652},{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","photo_id":"Zj3DgJHinzh2IifSx71rKg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Zj3DgJHinzh2IifSx71rKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8734140992164612},{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","photo_id":"Bsk1Z-XSnxNGnbCSmcDMeQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Bsk1Z-XSnxNGnbCSmcDMeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8645761013031006},{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","photo_id":"VcYkKhFtnomFfA1kJH0sbQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VcYkKhFtnomFfA1kJH0sbQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7990736961364746},{"business_id":"FlDkxuO6MGrW7x1OJTtJew","photo_id":"Pf-m4hgdTiy4cf2rcX-9oQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Pf-m4hgdTiy4cf2rcX-9oQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7871041893959045}]},"notebook_case":null}
